<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle details 10-month results.</title>
<headline>Nestle details 10-month results.</headline>
<dateline>VEVEY, Switzerland 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>10 months to October 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		  (In billions of Swiss francs unless stated).</p>
<p>    Group sales volume  48.3	  vs    45.7    +5.7 pct</p>
<p>Sales according to category</p>
<p>    Beverages	     13.0	  vs    12.8    +1.1 pct</p>
<p>Milk, dietary</p>
<p>    products, ice cream 13.6	  vs    12.7    +7.4 pct</p>
<p>Ready made meals,</p>
<p>    kitchen products    12.7	  vs    11.9    +6.3 pct</p>
<p>    Chocolate, sweets    7.1	  vs     6.5    +8.3 pct</p>
<p>    Pharmaceuticals	1.9	  vs     1.7   +12.6 pct</p>
<p>Sales according to region</p>
<p>    Europe		   22.4	 vs    21.4    +5.1 pct</p>
<p>    North,South America  16.6	 vs    15.7    +5.3 pct</p>
<p>    Other		     9.3	 vs     8.6    +8.0 pct.</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full company name is Nestle SA.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
